{"from":""Sobe, Liz H." <LSobe@rc.com>","subject":"Contract for boat tour / Robinson+Cole","body_snippet":"Hello, Dave. We have been reviewing the contract for the boat tour and have a few questions and concerns about the liability language, particularly the limitation of liability provision. As drafted, it absolves the company of any and all liability, including for intentional acts, that result in injury or death of our people or guests. That is not something we are comfortable signing as written. Would you be open to discussing some adjustments?

Liz H. Sobe
